## 1. Analysis & Pre-Thinking

**Core Requirements:**
1. Modal occupies full screen on mobile (currently has max-h limit and mx-4 margin)
2. ChatFilePreview needs a "Select" button to add file to message without previewing
3. Replace "Add message" (+) button with keyboard shortcut `Ctrl+Shift+Enter` 
4. Remove magnifier (search) tool from toolbar

**Strategic Approach:**
1. Update Modal.vue to be responsive - full screen on mobile
2. Update ChatFilePreview.vue to include a "Select" button that emits selection
3. Modify ChatInputBox.vue to handle `Ctrl+Shift+Enter` keyboard shortcut
4. Update Chat.vue to remove search message button from toolbar event emissions
5. Update ChatInputToolbar.vue to remove magnifier button and plus button

**Dependencies & Risks:**
- Modal used globally, ensure mobile fix doesn't break desktop behavior
- FilePreview selection must integrate with Chat.vue's file handling
- Keyboard shortcut must not conflict with existing Ctrl+Shift combinations

**Target Files:**
- `src/components/Modal.vue` - Add mobile responsive styling
- `src/components/chat/ChatFilePreview.vue` - Add select button
- `src/components/chat/ChatInputBox.vue` - Add Ctrl+Shift+Enter handling
- `src/components/chat/ChatInputToolbar.vue` - Remove buttons and update logic
- `src/components/chat/Chat.vue` - Update keyboard handler and remove search

